# Fine-tuning: the code, the report and the run evidence are the point of the
# directory, so track them. Only the weights are excluded — an adapter is 2.1 GB
# and lives in the private HF model repo, which is where a 2 GB binary belongs.
fine_tuning/**/*.safetensors
fine_tuning/**/*.pt
fine_tuning/**/*.pth
fine_tuning/runs/
fine_tuning/checkpoints/

# Forge scratch: FCStd/STEP/mesh output from local build sweeps, regenerated by
# orion/. The eval verdicts and model completions that back TRAINING_REPORT.md
# are kept deliberately, under fine_tuning/run_logs/evals/.
builds/

